      "content": "but it isn't just about \"my journey.\" it’s about the fact that their whole lives are built on this image of perfection, and i'm the one person who ruins it. i look at my parents and i just see how much of their dignity i take away just by being a disappointment. it feels like if i weren't here, the picture would finally be whole again.",
