      "content": "i know, i know. people always say that stuff. but you're an intelligent being, you understand logic. if a single piece of something is broken and it's ruining the entire structure, the most decent thing to do is to remove it so the rest can survive. it feels like the only way to actually be \"good\" for them is to just... stop being a problem.",
